<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-row">
      <view class="hero-mark">
        <ui-icon name="leaf" size="40" color="#5C7A5A"></ui-icon>
      </view>
      <view class="grow">
        <text class="eyebrow">FAMILY EDUCATION</text>
        <text class="hero-title">家庭教育讲师自学</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="hero-sub">目录来自 Zion「课程目录」60 课。点一门课，把课号和课程标题带进智学，按智能体自己的问答上课。</text>
    <text class="hero-meta" wx:if="{{!loading}}">{{categoryCount}} 个类别 · {{catalogCount}} 门课{{refreshing ? ' · 正在同步目录' : ''}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{loading}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">
      <ui-icon name="book-open" size="48" color="#8A8175"></ui-icon>
    </view>
    正在读取课程目录…
  </view>
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="cats" wx:if="{{categories.length > 1}}">
    <view
      class="cat {{activeCategory === item.id ? 'on' : ''}}"
      wx:for="{{categories}}"
      wx:key="id"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="onCategory"
    >{{item.name}}</view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !sections.length}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">
      <ui-icon name="empty" size="48" color="#8A8175"></ui-icon>
    </view>
    课程目录暂时没有数据。请下拉刷新，或确认已登录。
  </view>
  <view class="cat-table" wx:for="{{sections}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="section">
    <view class="cat-table-head">
      <ui-icon name="folder" size="32" color="#5C7A5A"></ui-icon>
      <text class="name">{{section.name}}</text>
      <text class="count">{{section.courses.length}} 门</text>
    </view>
    <view class="cat-table-empty" wx:if="{{!section.courses.length}}">该分类暂无课程</view>
    <view
      class="cat-row"
      wx:for="{{section.courses}}"
      wx:for-item="item"
      wx:key="lesson_code"
      data-code="{{item.lesson_code}}"
      data-title="{{item.title}}"
      bindtap="onOpen"
    >
      <text class="cat-idx">{{item.seq}}</text>
      <view class="grow">
        <view class="title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.lesson_code}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
